  "title": "Carrots and Onions Au Gratin",
  "description": "This is my mother-in law's recipe. She serves it at Christmas time and it is delicious. If you are looking for ways to get your family to eat more vegetables try this out!",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer Thibodeau"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:08:41-04:00",
